config TINYML_APP_BENCH
	bool "Benchmark (UART-streamed model)"
	select SERIAL
	select UART_INTERRUPT_DRIVEN
	help
	  Host-driven test harness: the model and input data are streamed in
	  over the data UART (uart2) using a framed protocol, and results / RAM
	  usage / operator lists / profiler traces are streamed back to the PC
	  tool.  Requires the interrupt-driven UART and the uart2 node enabled
	  by the board overlay.
